EN.update({'切换平台 Codex / Claude':'Switch platform Codex / Claude','切换额度周期 5 小时 / 每周':'Switch quota window 5 hours / weekly','尚未允许系统通知，点击按钮后在系统弹框里选「允许」':'System notifications are not allowed yet; click the button and choose Allow','系统通知已允许；额度低于门槛时由控制台发出':'System notifications allowed; the console posts them when quota is low','测试通知已发出；没看到的话检查专注模式或系统通知设置':'Test notification sent; check Focus or notification settings if nothing appeared','系统通知已被关闭，点击按钮直接打开系统设置的通知页':'System notifications are turned off; click to open the notification settings','正在请求系统通知权限…':'Requesting system notification permission…','请求系统通知权限失败，请重试':'Could not request system notification permission; try again','发送测试通知':'Send test notification','打开系统通知设置':'Open notification settings','开启系统通知':'Enable system notifications','额度提醒由控制台 App 以系统通知发出，第一次需要在这里授权；在浏览器里打开控制台时，可另外开启浏览器通知。自动停止由本机控制器独立执行，不依赖通知开关。':'Quota alerts are posted by the console app as system notifications and need a one-time permission here; when the console is opened in a browser you can also enable browser notifications. Automatic stop runs in the local controller and does not depend on notifications.'})
